<Base>
<h1>Clessidra</h1>
<p class="lead">It's the instrument where you pour grains of sound from single drops into a dense cloud.</p>

<div class="prose">
  <p>Clessidra is a granular instrument inspired by the hourglass. Record a sound and it becomes sand: a loop that falls grain by grain, as slow single drops or as a fast, dense trickle. Slow it down, speed it up, reverse it or freeze it. Let it run out once, turn the glass over, or let it go round. Every grain can differ in size, pitch, shape and timing, so the sound is gathered and pieced back together, never quite the same and never fully still.</p>
</div>

